OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FCat-lover Eileen welcomes her
OL,7,     Frivals to the four-star Thornley
OL,8,     FHouse in Allendale,
OL,9,     FNorthumberland. But Eileen's
OL,10,     Fbeloved and very large cats are
OL,11,     Fnot to all of her guests' liking.
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJessica and Adrian hope that the
OL,14,     Fbeautiful Cornish coastal
OL,15,     Fsurroundings will make up for the
OL,16,     Fsnugness of the three-bedroom Chy
OL,17,     FConyn in St Ives. Will their
OL,18,     Fguests agree?
